Package: copyclip
Version: 1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, xclip
Maintainer: Ujjawal <ujjawal200@github.com>
Description: Lightweight clipboard history manager for Linux
 CopyClip monitors your clipboard and stores the last 20 copied texts.
 Access your clipboard history from the system tray icon.
 Built for developers who copy-paste frequently.
Homepage: https://github.com/ujjawal200/copyclip
